{"hash": "6d80df3f637fd27bcaee2f2b7f95f3bc3a72c5f892d119557b89c1daf07ee434", "id": "T-t1-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "genesis", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 7, "line_start": 7, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. A human must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "cf79e00d958dee7f0a68d0feb81908a7e04598cab4e8ee3683fc1ae319e9cf9e", "id": "T-t1-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6d80df3f637fd27bcaee2f2b7f95f3bc3a72c5f892d119557b89c1daf07ee434", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 8, "line_start": 8, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. An agent must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "4876dcb84e2ecd8cc69858ecf0800e2688ce03b0e56bc1dcf79d1be126c0b517", "id": "T-t1-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "cf79e00d958dee7f0a68d0feb81908a7e04598cab4e8ee3683fc1ae319e9cf9e", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 9, "line_start": 9, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. An internal or external event must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "dd1de541b478e8cf80a0a6165e5d38b91b5fe8eeaccab16f3597fa15035256de", "id": "T-t2-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "4876dcb84e2ecd8cc69858ecf0800e2688ce03b0e56bc1dcf79d1be126c0b517", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 13, "line_start": 13, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Composability hides the complexity.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "2cfc4f9eff8b499607cd08eff5b2655984fbe86d0b438564fa7ba08945754007", "id": "T-t2-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "dd1de541b478e8cf80a0a6165e5d38b91b5fe8eeaccab16f3597fa15035256de", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 14, "line_start": 14, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Composability allows enhancing particular aspects of any element without touching the rest.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "fc1ebfa1297b339c45dc2b513cc8a0669c49ca5744f0e7ee27a1d1862f80853d", "id": "T-t2-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "2cfc4f9eff8b499607cd08eff5b2655984fbe86d0b438564fa7ba08945754007", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 15, "line_start": 15, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. State, telemetry, and every cross-cutting concern are managed across the entire structure, whichever entry point was used.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "9f329e7c0a5030dcb723a45b1c80959cf0456a80f02029116f00123b6852eb55", "id": "T-t3-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "fc1ebfa1297b339c45dc2b513cc8a0669c49ca5744f0e7ee27a1d1862f80853d", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 19, "line_start": 19, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. It has to be simple to use.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "82103a7ed45e1c92a0e0e11e2ee003c8a694160caa4d4f14cdd9ce0fcfb88fdb", "id": "T-t3-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "9f329e7c0a5030dcb723a45b1c80959cf0456a80f02029116f00123b6852eb55", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 20, "line_start": 20, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. It cannot be daunting or overly complex, or no one will use it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "e0fa0b513b56c27ff55cf604fc75e18a487648a2057dd4248262f2f2dd0084ac", "id": "T-t4-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "82103a7ed45e1c92a0e0e11e2ee003c8a694160caa4d4f14cdd9ce0fcfb88fdb", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 24, "line_start": 24, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Treat this as a baseline target and improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "09ee02e22b1400b958121968e131dc52e87ea11bd8a7c8165500faa68f5fcc4b", "id": "T-t4-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "e0fa0b513b56c27ff55cf604fc75e18a487648a2057dd4248262f2f2dd0084ac", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 25, "line_start": 25, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Decompose it; add the skills, loops, and agents needed to reach it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "332ce16a468bc4de0964a0760eb744979aece42ff3fa8b41af42341e4e63cf9e", "id": "T-t4-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "09ee02e22b1400b958121968e131dc52e87ea11bd8a7c8165500faa68f5fcc4b", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 26, "line_start": 26, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. PASS.md's list is a limited baseline: understand what an end-to-end version is, make up for the gaps, and solve it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "b4bd87c671f246fe0e8476519910f60c1b595950d113981f1c6baa459b112136", "id": "T-t4-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "332ce16a468bc4de0964a0760eb744979aece42ff3fa8b41af42341e4e63cf9e", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 27, "line_start": 27, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Work through every item with a self-improvement loop: at the end of each section a ceremony re-reviews the output, improves the skills that produced it, and the loop continues.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "8bc449b54503295c483adadfbd83d45f9e876c3035fad80dabd553320c73a9b9", "id": "T-t5-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b4bd87c671f246fe0e8476519910f60c1b595950d113981f1c6baa459b112136", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 31, "line_start": 31, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Do not stop at ceremonies; run them and continue.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "7417ac179dbbe634eadc069012a8971e322905608efe0b417c637c74366581b2", "id": "T-t5-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "8bc449b54503295c483adadfbd83d45f9e876c3035fad80dabd553320c73a9b9", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 32, "line_start": 32, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. When a problem comes up, use 1-3-1: define the problem, identify the three best possible solutions that align to the goal, and follow the recommendation.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "859e64bd1c8fd06ae1033ace1d6d3515ba12e22fdc96394fe78c8ed211d2e1b0", "id": "T-t5-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "7417ac179dbbe634eadc069012a8971e322905608efe0b417c637c74366581b2", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 33, "line_start": 33, "sha256": "031a989e68ef2e005b3cbf8d288ed5b93f05f1ed2fd9f34256c5eef5a81a5430"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. If no recommendation is found, drop the two lowest solutions, find two more, and repeat until solved.", "type": "fact"}
